TF_LISTENER:
this code records the true x y position of the car in rviz simulation and prints it to a csv file
run this node after running your rviz simulator, otherwise the /tf topic will not exist
make sure node is run from root of repo (f1tenth_system)
node can be run with the following command: ros2 run tf_listener tf_logger
the resulting csv file will be saved at tf_listener/data

POSITION_ERROR_CODE:
open in vscode, and make sure to cd into f1tenth_system
simply run in csvode
theoretical path = raceline from raceline optimisation code
actual path = true position from tf_listener

